{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set a Watch is an adaptation of modern board game. Tactical dice management gameplay offers unique decisions for the players trying to fight back creatures. Control a party of unique adventurers, each with distinct skills to vanquish evil before the Unhallowed consume the world in darkness. Secure nine locations to prevent the acolytes from breaking the seals ... and try to survive. Every dice roll determines your actions\u2014attack, rest, or prepare for the next wave. Plan wisely, fight strategically, and survive the darkness. Will you rise to the challenge?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Victory is earned, not given.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/extras/abc6304d50e93f5ec5df60c9ab83d5df.poster.avif?t=1759324417\" width=766 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/extras/abc6304d50e93f5ec5df60c9ab83d5df.webm?t=1759324417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/extras/abc6304d50e93f5ec5df60c9ab83d5df.mp4?t=1759324417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters using your special skills. Attack directly with dice or activate the right abilities. The right timing for each spell is key to surviving so use your options carefully - mistakes can cost you a run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dice Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/extras/c9c368c3460a3e5912afa5341085294c.poster.avif?t=1759324417\" width=670 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/extras/c9c368c3460a3e5912afa5341085294c.webm?t=1759324417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/extras/c9c368c3460a3e5912afa5341085294c.mp4?t=1759324417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll first, strategize next\u2014every result is useful if you play it right. Finding the best way out of multiple options is the key to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose special abilities to prepare before each battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/extras/e075c5c39603aa7311f1e75ff9a79fa9.poster.avif?t=1759324417\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/extras/e075c5c39603aa7311f1e75ff9a79fa9.webm?t=1759324417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/extras/e075c5c39603aa7311f1e75ff9a79fa9.mp4?t=1759324417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your actions wisely\u2014Heal, Scout, Equip, or Light the Fire. Will you unleash powerful magic runes now or save your best dice for the battle ahead?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Six unique heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick members of your team before your journey. Build the best squad or experiment with different combinations from six adventurers with unique skills.  Will you overpower foes with a brute-force warrior, outwit them with a wizard\u2019s magic, tame forest creatures to your advantage, or stand resilient in the light as a cleric?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular and Unhallowed monster abilities combine with each other, 20 different locations, 6 heroes, 30 abilities, and countless outcomes. Will you claim victory? <i>Set a watch</i>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493430?t=1759324417","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/d41dc71b6557e4c06afcd2eee32466b1cbd36ea5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759324417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/d6bc8d150243540f488d3ee2ce13a0b9552d1467/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759324417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493430/d6bc8d150243540f488d3ee2ce13a0b9552d1467/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759324417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4060540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set a Watch is an adaptation of modern board game. Tactical dice management gameplay offers unique decisions for the players trying to fight back creatures. Control a party of unique adventurers, each with distinct skills to vanquish evil before the Unhallowed consume the world in darkness. Secure nine locations to prevent the acolytes from breaking the seals ... and try to survive. Every dice roll determines your actions\u2014attack, rest, or prepare for the next wave. Plan wisely, fight strategically, and survive the darkness. Will you rise to the challenge?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Victory is earned, not given.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as